Prime Agent is an open-source, self-improving AI coding assistant
powered by an IPython-backed execution kernel. It supports multi-turn
agentic coding, multi-provider LLMs, tool calling, conversation
persistence, and a rich terminal user interface.

Features:
  - Interactive terminal UI and autonomous agent loop
  - Embedded Python kernel with ZeroMQ communication
  - Built-in skills for web search, linear, notion, images, and tools
  - Support for multiple LLM providers (Prime Intellect, Anthropic,
    OpenAI, etc.)
